prompt:
Professional T-pose character turnaround model sheet of the EXACT same man shown in the reference image, for building a realistic 3D video-game character.

IDENTITY (must match the reference 100%): same face shape, eyes, nose and mouth; same short dark hair and hairline; same full dark beard of the same length; same skin tone and age; same height, build and body proportions; same outfit with identical colors, fabric and details: dark charcoal suit jacket, dark shirt, dark trousers, black leather shoes. Do not redesign, stylize, idealize, slim down or beautify him. No hat, no glasses, no accessories that are not in the reference.

LAYOUT: one single wide landscape image on a pure flat uniform light-grey studio background (#BFBFBF). No floor texture, no shadows on the ground, no props, no text, no labels, no numbers, no grid, no watermark. Exactly four full-body views in one horizontal row, left to right, evenly spaced and not overlapping:
1) FRONT view, facing the camera directly;
2) THREE-QUARTER view, body rotated 45 degrees;
3) exact SIDE profile view, body rotated 90 degrees;
4) BACK view, body rotated 180 degrees, showing the back of the head and jacket.
All four views at exactly the same scale and height, feet on the same invisible ground line, the whole body from top of the hair to the soles of the shoes visible with a small margin above and below. Arms must not be cut off by the image edges or overlap the neighbouring view.

POSE (identical in all four views): strict T-pose. Both arms stretched straight out horizontally to the sides at shoulder height, elbows straight, wrists straight, palms facing down, fingers together and extended, thumbs relaxed. Legs straight, feet shoulder-width apart, toes pointing forward. Spine upright, shoulders level, head straight, neutral relaxed expression, mouth closed, eyes looking straight ahead in the direction the body faces. Jacket buttoned so it does not hide the body silhouette.

STYLE: photorealistic, like a high-end photogrammetry capture photo shoot. Even, soft, diffuse, shadowless studio lighting from the front, identical lighting and white balance in all four views, no rim light, no dramatic color grading, no depth of field blur, everything in sharp focus. Orthographic-like camera at chest height with no perspective distortion (long telephoto lens look). Natural real skin and fabric texture, high detail.

